    skos:related <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/1484> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Printing technique through which a tactile bas-relief is created, that is also visible under oblique light."@en .

<https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/904> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/491> ;
