        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/600>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/724> ;
    skos:scopeNote "The conceptual scheme that refers to the nexus of common values, perceptions and actions that characteriσe collectivities and groups. The conceptual features of the community involve the composition of collective identities and the emergence of symbolic boundaries, which shape the consciousness of common belonging into a distinct and coherent whole."@en .

