        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/2188> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Identifying marks made up of a number of letters overlaid and/or ligatured. These are often found on coins as mint-marks or control-marks, or in countermarks."@en .

<https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/2205> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/240> ;
