    skos:scopeNote "The social status of persons engaged in marriage. It encompasses specific roles, identities, rights and obligations within and beyond the family established upon marriage."@en .

<https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/309> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/26> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ethnocultural groups"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Population groups, whose members share common cultural traditions and historical experiences; on the basis of these elements ethnocultural groups form a distinct collective identity that distinguishes them from other groups."@en .

