    skos:related <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/2424> ;
    skos:scopeNote "The systematic cultivation of the soil, the production and primary processing of plant products, with an aim to meet dietary and clothing needs."@en .

