<https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/339> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/25> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Descent"@en ;
    skos:related <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/108>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/342>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/351>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/49>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/61>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/695> ;
    skos:scopeNote "The principles that determine the affiliation of a person, upon their birth, to a kinship group, and define the biological and social relationships with the other members of this group. Descent is based upon consanguinity bonds and is acknowledged by persons within and/or beyond the kinship group; thus, it regulates the transfer of goods, as well as the inheritance of social identities and statuses."@en .

