        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/52>,
        <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/75> ;
    skos:scopeNote "Groups of individuals who display interaction with each other, share common traits as to their social, political, cultural and economic activity, develop common goals and have a sense of belonging together. As a rule, the social groups are also institutionally distinguished and defined."@en .

