    skos:scopeNote "Groups of magistrates, usually with equal and co-responsible members, with specific duties and responsibilities."@en .

<https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/458> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://humanitiesthesaurus.academyofathens.gr/dyas-resource/Concept/256> ;
