    skos:scopeNote "Small metal objects which follow a specific weight standard (i.e. they are standardized in weight and metal content) and are stamped with inscriptions, numbers and designs that declare the value of the coins and also certify the sovereign guarantee which allows for them to circulate as a medium of exchange."@en .

